Build a modern full-stack Employee Fun & Engagement Platform using Next.js 15, TypeScript, Tailwind CSS, shadcn/ui, MongoDB, Mongoose, NextAuth/Auth.js, Zustand, and Socket.io.

The platform is designed for companies to improve employee engagement, reduce burnout, and create fun workplace interaction through mini games, challenges, leaderboards, and team activities.

==================================================
TECH STACK
==================================================

Frontend:
- Next.js 15 App Router
- TypeScript
- Tailwind CSS
- shadcn/ui
- Framer Motion
- Zustand

Backend:
- Next.js Route Handlers
- MongoDB Atlas
- Mongoose
- Socket.io
- NextAuth/Auth.js

Other:
- Cloudinary for image uploads
- Firebase FCM for push notifications

